-----------------------------------------------

This mod builds against Oxygen Not Included's game assemblies and is
distributed under Klei Entertainment's Mod and UGC guidelines:

  https://support.klei.com/hc/en-us/articles/27787028069012

Those guidelines do NOT permit commercial use of the mod. That restriction
